<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Forcenergy rating upped. [CORRECTED 18:29 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Forcenergy rating upped. [CORRECTED 18:29 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs has raised its rating on Forcenergy Inc to trading buy (corrects rating) from market outperform, a source said Monday.</p>
<p>-- Forcenergy shares were trading at 26-1/4 on Monday, up 7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
